<title>JAPAN: Toho Real Estate to issue $50 mln warrant.</title>
<headline>Toho Real Estate to issue $50 mln warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Toho Real Estate Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Daiwa Europe Ltd</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Sanwa Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   50 million dollar</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 10.Jul.01</p>
<p> EXER PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p>EXER FROM 24.Jul.97  EXER TO 26.Jun.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 10.Jul.97  INT PAY 10.Jul</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 30.Jun.97 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on June 30.</p>
</text>
